        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fidel Castro, Ruby Hart Phillips, Fulgencio Batista\n- Organizations: 26th of July Movement\n- Roles: President of Cuba, journalist\n\nFacts:\n- Fulgencio Batista first served as President of Cuba in 1940.\n- Fidel Castro led the 26th of July Movement in Cuba.\n- Someone claimed that Fidel Castro had been killed in the 26th of July Movement.\n- Ruby Hart Phillips was at odds with Fulgencio Batista.\n- The man who proved the claim about Fidel Castro wrong was Fulgencio Batista.",
